# @hub-lanes

# ── MERGIFY SYNC (BH-1699, 2026-09-23) ───────────────────────────────────────
# Daily at 06:47Z: is each repo that has a config/mergify/repos/<repo>.conf
# still running the .mergify.yml the harness template renders for it? Read-only.
# One ALERTS line per DRIFT, MISSING or UNREADABLE repo per UTC day, and a
# DRIFT line names its fix, `bin/mergify-sync.sh apply <slug>`, which stays an
# operator command: it opens a PR on a harness/mergify-sync-* branch and never
# merges. A repo without a conf is never read.
47 6 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/mergify-sync.sh check >/dev/null 2>&1
